    {
      "id": "claim_ae4eeab99cfc42c484161864d5209bb5",
      "statement": "The clip editor distinguishes clip frames, which index the whole baked animation, from slice frames, which are relative to startFrame and are what GaitPhase.Footfall stores; ClipEditorContext owns the conversion and exposes ClipFrameCount and SliceFrameCount rather than the shadowed FrameCount member.",
